This prepares the coordinator for later Storage and Parser extraction while preserving all existing console output.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":109,"deletions":58}}},{"hash":"7db16d42badf78a1ef1902a8652f3ef6f37fe2ab","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract task persistence into Storage","messageBody":"Move filesystem access and saved-task reconstruction into a dedicated\nStorage class. This keeps PotatoBot focused on coordinating application\nflow instead of managing persistence details.\n\nPreserve missing-file handling, task-count validation, and the existing\nsave format so users retain their stored tasks and console behavior. The\nnew boundary also makes persistence easier to evolve independently.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":146,"deletions":107}}},{"hash":"98c3c440d8e46d06f967712e410171fe4e5c9c51","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract user input parsing into Parser","messageBody":"Move command-word interpretation, argument parsing, and task\ncreation into a dedicated Parser. Represent each result as an immutable\nCommand so PotatoBot receives structured data instead of dissecting raw\ntext.\n\nKeep command execution in PotatoBot to maintain a clear boundary\nbetween understanding user input and changing application state.\nValidate missing deadline and event delimiters as user-facing command\nerrors.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":139,"deletions":73}}},{"hash":"691d202187bc77d562b9026dee7dad993d3dfb72","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Make commands execute polymorphically","messageBody":"Replace the parsed-command data holder and PotatoBot execution switch\nwith an abstract Command API and focused command subclasses. Each\ncommand now owns the task-list changes and user feedback for its\nbehavior.\n\nShare task-number validation in TaskNumberCommand to keep mark,\nunmark, and delete consistent. Let ExitCommand save tasks and report\nshutdown so the main loop only parses, executes, and checks whether to\nstop.\n","tags":["A-MoreOOP"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":174,"deletions":114}}},{"hash":"fc7fe31009f79cb9729394d5ad169ff5ac8dc280","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027A-MoreOOP\u0027","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-08-28T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"6df411354964a8d491aa89df8edc80cff23e4514","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027add-gradle-support\u0027","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"dcc5fa99c7bb1ae6b7a269b7ca48900b6dd7232b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix gradle compatibility with project","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2},"java":{"insertions":178,"deletions":42},"md":{"insertions":69,"deletions":35}}},{"hash":"a312a913cd55306db3e5a8bf3a9c620da49190da","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add testing for commandtype","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":47,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"2f4becdcef18d606707271b474a88280b3177d32","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Expand JUnit coverage for core logic","messageBody":"Add focused tests for parser branching, task-list mutations and\nlimits, date validation, and storage save and load behavior. Cover both\nsuccessful workflows and important failure boundaries.\n\nDocument the 50% high-value-method coverage target in AGENTS.md and\nrequire JUnit tests to be reviewed after every code change so future\nwork preserves that target.\n","tags":["A-JUnit"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":451,"deletions":0},"md":{"insertions":4,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"17f575a4574cf966764b10b0efdfbb0ab909961e","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027A-JUnit\u0027","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"941cb5476444a1b5e2c39a17385b0fb7e47d7196","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update Readme with new project metadata","messa